  "detail_text": "Amendment 0001: The purpose of this amendment is to extend the closing date and time from 2:00 PM on 20 February 2026 to 2:00 PM on 6 March 2026. Amendment 0002: The purpose of this amendment is to 1. Extend the proposal due date until 13 March 2026 at 2pm (Eastern Standard Time). 2. Provide Answers to submitted questions in Section B. 3. Replace the original GFI Attachment with an updated attachment that now includes Drawing #WS20972A in Section J. 4. Add Drawing WS20972A to attacments in Section J. 5. Add Government Furnished Property list to Section J.",
